   "t": "Here's what I'd suggest. Keep the bedroom cool, light cotton nightwear, and a fan."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "We've got a fan. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Avoid hot drinks and spicy food in the evening."
